---
// Footer — always dark background (navy-deep)
---

<footer style="background: var(--navy-deep); color: #C7CDE0; padding: 80px 0 0;">
  <div style="max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px;">
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1.5fr; gap: 48px; padding-bottom: 64px; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">

      <!-- Col 1: Brand -->
      <div>
        <!-- Logo dark variant (ring white) -->
        <a href="/" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <svg width="44" height="44" viewBox="0 0 44 44" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <path d="M 32 11 A 14 14 0 1 0 32 29" stroke="rgba(255,255,255,0.9)" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M14.5 27 L20 13 L25.5 27 M16.6 22.5 L23.4 22.5" stroke="#22C58E" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
            <path d="M22.5 22.5 L31 30.6 L27.8 31.1 L29.6 34.3 L27.6 35.4 L25.8 32.2 L23.4 33.6 Z" fill="#22C58E"/>
          </svg>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; line-height: 1; gap: 1px;">
            <span style="font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: white;">CAMANDRE</span>
            <span style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 9.5px; letter-spacing: 0.32em; color: #22C58E; font-weight: 500;">FACTORY</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); margin-bottom: 24px; max-width: 280px;">
          Diseñamos, construimos y mantenemos las plataformas y sistemas que sostienen empresas con ambiciones técnicas reales.
        </p>

        <!-- Availability chip -->
        <div style="
          display: inline-flex;
          align-items: center;
          gap: 8px;
          padding: 8px 14px;
          background: rgba(34,197,142,0.1);
          border: 1px solid rgba(34,197,142,0.25);
          border-radius: 20px;
          font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
          font-size: 11px;
          color: #22C58E;
          font-weight: 500;
        ">
          <span class="cf-pulse" style="
            display: inline-block;
            width: 7px; height: 7px;
            background: #22C58E;
            border-radius: 50%;
            flex-shrink: 0;
          "></span>
          Aceptamos 2 proyectos · Q3 2026
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Servicios -->
      <div>
        <h4 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px;">Servicios</h4>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <li><a href="/servicios" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">Producto Web</a></li>
          <li><a href="/servicios" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">Sistemas a medida</a></li>
          <li><a href="/servicios" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">Infraestructura</a></li>
          <li><a href="/servicios" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">Consultoría TI</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Camandre -->
      <div>
        <h4 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px;">Camandre</h4>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <li><a href="/nosotros" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">Nosotros</a></li>
          <li><a href="/portafolio" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">Portafolio</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">Diario técnico</a></li>
          <li><a href="#" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">Carreras</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Contacto -->
      <div>
        <h4 style="font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 20px;">Contacto</h4>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
          <li>
            <a href="mailto:hola@camandre.factory" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">
              hola@camandre.factory
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="tel:+573002481190" style="font-size: 14px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.7); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='#22C58E'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.7)'">
              +57 300 248 1190
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.55); line-height: 1.5;">Calle 93 #14–20<br>Bogotá, Colombia</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span style="font-size: 12px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.4); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;">Madrid · CDMX · Remoto</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom bar -->
    <div style="
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 24px 0;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px;
    ">
      <p style="font-size: 12px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.4); margin: 0; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;">
        © 2026 Camandre Factory. Todos los derechos reservados.
      </p>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center;">
        <a href="#" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.4); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='white'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.4)'">Privacidad</a>
        <a href="#" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.4); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='white'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.4)'">Términos</a>
        <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.4); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='white'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.4)'">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="font-size: 12px; color: rgba(199,205,224,0.4); transition: color 0.2s;" onmouseover="this.style.color='white'" onmouseout="this.style.color='rgba(199,205,224,0.4)'">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    footer > div > div:first-of-type {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr !important;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    footer > div > div:first-of-type {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr !important;
    }
  }
</style>
